AuthorDate: Fri Jun 27 17:36:57 2025 +0000
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Fri Jun 27 17:36:57 2025 +0000

    Bug 1967386 - Make createAccount() an async function in XPCSHELL tests. r=edicharry,babolivier

    In D252640 support for EWS accounts was added, which need to perform an
    async operation during account creation. Initially the function
    `createAccount()` was updated to only return a Promise for EWS accounts
    (and needs to be awaited), but not for all other account types.

    This patch updates all function calls to `createAccount()` to be
    awaited, and updates the function to be a proper async function.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D255108

